🇺🇸🇮🇷US Strikes Iran Amid Fake "Ceasefire" and Even Faker "MOU"

▪️The US struck targets in Iran following Iran's interdiction of unauthorized shipping in the Strait of Hormuz;

▪️ The interdiction is taking place specifically because the US and Israel have completely and repeatedly violated the terms of both the "ceasefire" and "MOU" by continuing to attack Hezbollah in Lebanon;

▪️US policymakers note that Iran's regional defensive posture includes using groups like Hezbollah to create strategic depth - thus, by attempting to eliminate features of Iran's defense is a blatant continuation of attacking, isolating and attempting to eliminate Iran itself;

▪️All notions of a "US-Israeli" divide or any desire for "peace" by the US is simply a facade this blatant aggression continues behind;

▪️The US will not end hostilities against Iran, Russia, or China until fundamental, GLOBAL structural changes take place to PHYSICALLY stop US aggression, both direct and by proxy;
